### 8. Attempt the draw with groupSize unbound.
### Actual response in this run: 400
###   {"type":"https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc9110#section-15.5.1",
###    "title":"drawPhase.parameterUnbound","status":400,
###    "detail":"Parameter 'groupSize' has no binding in the provided
###    bindings dictionary.", ...}
### This is the failure BindParameter exists to clear — before this thread,
### nothing in the system could clear it.
POST {{baseUrl}}/draw-phase
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "competitionId": { "value": "{{nzmCompId}}" },
  "rounds": 2
}

### 9. Bind groupSize to 6 — two groups of 6 from the 12 registered
### competitors.
### Actual response: 200, body {"value":"019fdfc8-3499-7200-adee-f9cec81fd6cc"}
POST {{baseUrl}}/bind-parameter
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "competitionRef": { "value": "{{nzmCompId}}" },
  "parameterName": "groupSize",
  "value": { "kind": "Number", "number": 6 },
  "by": "CD Jane"
}

### 10. Draw again.
### Actual response: 200, body {"value":"019fdfc8-3499-7200-adee-f9cec81fd6cc"}
### — success, where the unbound attempt in step 8 failed for the same
### competition, the same rounds, the one difference being step 9's bind.
POST {{baseUrl}}/draw-phase
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "competitionId": { "value": "{{nzmCompId}}" },
  "rounds": 2
}

### 11. Confirm via GET /competition: two rounds, each with two groups of
### exactly 6 competitors (the bound value), and parameterBindings carries
### the groupSize binding by "CD Jane". Verified in this run — both rounds'
### task-round groups had CompetitorRefs.Length == 6, 12 unique competitors
### placed each round, and parameterBindings contained exactly the one
### groupSize=6 entry.
GET {{baseUrl}}/competition?Id={{nzmCompId}}
